1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,122
Once you open the automatic setup app

2
00:00:02,122 --> 00:00:05,400
this will be super easy Click Start Setup Process

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,596
Your keepers will be generated in a second

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,596
You actually don't need to download these two

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,800
but if you want to connect to this Snowflake account

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,300
with anything else like a SQL client or your own BI tools

7
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,000
or anything outside of this course

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,400
then you probably want to download both your private key and your public key

9
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:32,175
But I'm embedding these two into the files

10
00:00:32,175 --> 00:00:33,794
that you will download later

11
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:37,794
so for the course strictly speaking you don't need it

12
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,397
So click Continue to Snowflake Setup

13
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:45,394
So here what you need to do is set up your Snowflake account

14
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,199
which is not your username

15
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,596
The easiest way to go is to come back to your email

16
00:00:51,596 --> 00:00:53,794
and just copy paste this URL

17
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,797
Copy this URL paste it in there

18
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:59,464
and then when you press Enter

19
00:00:59,464 --> 00:01:04,793
then the app will extract your Snowflake account name from the URL

20
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,400
Now the username if you used admin as I did

21
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,200
just keep it at admin

22
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:15,600
and then for the password I will just go and use my password

23
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:19,200
that I added and please do the same

24
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,800
Once you're done click Start Setup

25
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:26,193
And if you've been enrolled into a multi factor authentication

26
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:29,793
Snowflake does this with some of the registrations

27
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:33,157
then now is the time to check your phone

28
00:01:33,157 --> 00:01:37,925
because in your Duo app you will see confirmation notification

29
00:01:37,925 --> 00:01:40,200
that you will need to approve

30
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:44,195
This might take not more than two minutes of setting up everything

31
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:50,000
So it's importing the row tables like the listings and the reviews and so on

32
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,800
You can take a look at the actual sequence if you want

33
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:57,220
sets up the dbt user and also sets up the reset user

34
00:01:57,220 --> 00:01:59,600
and then verifies these rows

35
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:02,400
Okay so this has been complete

36
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:06,000
So now we are ready to download the configuration files

37
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:09,756
This is a super important step so don't skip it

38
00:02:09,756 --> 00:02:13,780
because then you will need to do everything from ground zero

39
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:17,200
First there is a dbtprofiles yml

40
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,000
We will learn more about this later

41
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,997
This is basically your dbt connection configuration

42
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:25,290
Please click it and download it to somewhere

43
00:02:25,290 --> 00:02:29,591
where you will be able to copy it from into your dbt project later

44
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:32,400
Also there is the preset instructions

45
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:35,760
which includes a configuration file for the BI tool

46
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:38,400
that we are using later in the course

47
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:42,196
So please download preset instructions too

48
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:44,243
So keep these two files handy

49
00:02:44,243 --> 00:02:47,194
as we are going to need them in the next videos

50
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:50,073
In the next lecture I will show you what happens behind the scenes

51
00:02:50,073 --> 00:02:51,594
of this automatic Snowflake app

52
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,796
But if you just want to get going

53
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:58,360
then feel free to just tick the check mark in the next lecture

54
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:01,400
and mark it completed and skip over it
